Applying your “Burn Math Class” rule

I would use this catalog as the inventory, then assign teaching levels according to whether a piece needs a new association or can already be constructed.

For example:

Piece	Teaching treatment

木 — tree	Introduce the basic shape and association.
艮 — silver	Introduce the assigned component image as a unit.
根 — root	Build it from the known 木 and 艮 pieces.
莫 — graveyard	Show flowers + sun + large dog; retain the construction behind the new chunk name.
粦 — shoeshine	Show rice + sunglasses; it is a named compound.
